[{"client_msg_id":"26fe6c73-dfcc-4bd4-b346-033e767e990e","type":"message","user":"U0243L4CP70","text":"（ycinoさんと直接雑談しててgo-to-definitionの話になったのでそのデモの位置を伝えた）","ts":"1631975339.137800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q1df"}]},{"client_msg_id":"caaeb3d2-ad73-4f8a-a5bb-8751b16e4eb8","type":"message","user":"U0243L4CP70","text":"\u003c@U8996GYBF\u003e \u003chttps://youtu.be/uNttp63ELoE?t=700\u003e","ts":"1631974641.137100","attachments":[{"fallback":"YouTube Video: [JA][Keynote] TypeProf for IDE: Enrich Dev-Experience without Annotations / Yusuke Endoh @mame","id":1,"author_name":"RubyKaigi","author_link":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBSg5zH-VFJ42BGQFk4VH2A","title":"[JA][Keynote] TypeProf for IDE: Enrich Dev-Experience without Annotations / Yusuke Endoh @mame","title_link":"https://youtu.be/uNttp63ELoE?t=700","thumb_url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uNttp63ELoE/hqdefault.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"YouTube","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/youtube.png","thumb_width":480,"thumb_height":360,"video_html":"\u003ciframe width=\"400\" height=\"225\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uNttp63ELoE?start=700\u0026feature=oembed\u0026start=700\u0026autoplay=1\u0026iv_load_policy=3\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","video_html_width":400,"video_html_height":225,"from_url":"https://youtu.be/uNttp63ELoE?t=700","original_url":"https://youtu.be/uNttp63ELoE?t=700"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t5DIk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"AA6266FF-B7A1-4A3F-8271-16535F11BE26","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"これすごいですよね","ts":"1631970806.136800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PPQPQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45496070-c56b-44c3-9ca0-acb994030e6b","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"お、見てみます","ts":"1631970794.136400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TqcY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a4564bf7-8046-40a9-9bd9-e89b43809580","type":"message","user":"UCFEJF487","text":"「型とLSP」という文脈では、mameさんの作っている \u003chttps://github.com/ruby/typeprof\u003e が型推論とLSP対応をがんばっていますね。\n\u003chttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uNttp63ELoE\u003e\nこの発表なかなか衝撃的なので見てみてほしいです！","ts":"1631970572.136000","attachments":[{"fallback":"YouTube Video: [JA][Keynote] TypeProf for IDE: Enrich Dev-Experience without Annotations / Yusuke Endoh @mame","id":1,"author_name":"RubyKaigi","author_link":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBSg5zH-VFJ42BGQFk4VH2A","title":"[JA][Keynote] TypeProf for IDE: Enrich Dev-Experience without Annotations / Yusuke Endoh @mame","title_link":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uNttp63ELoE","thumb_url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uNttp63ELoE/hqdefault.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"YouTube","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/youtube.png","thumb_width":480,"thumb_height":360,"video_html":"\u003ciframe width=\"400\" height=\"225\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uNttp63ELoE?feature=oembed\u0026autoplay=1\u0026iv_load_policy=3\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","video_html_width":400,"video_html_height":225,"from_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uNttp63ELoE","original_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uNttp63ELoE"},{"color":"24292f","fallback":"ruby/typeprof","id":2,"title":"ruby/typeprof","text":"An experimental type-level Ruby interpreter for testing and understanding Ruby code","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"438","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Ruby","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y7Bs8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b2daf648-f0d5-4378-b16c-5fcf96e32bb0","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"それはそう・・・","ts":"1631970264.135400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"derlH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7a3971b-c5b4-488c-9dc9-8675f2f7dfa7","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"モチベーションはあるわけなのでコントリビュートしていきましょう","ts":"1631969858.135000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bDNN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d813a934-3ac2-4760-9d8e-a2bd45c3d0ea","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Ruby は今型周りをがんばって整備しているところで、人手も大いにほしい状況なので、完全に :contribute-chance: ですよ\nつらいことをつらいと言うのは構わないと思いますけど、ずっと言ってるだけだと OSS ただのりおじさんみたいになるかなーと思います","ts":"1631969833.134700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W6Lb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e201f8cd-d5c7-465a-9670-03f887b68f81","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あればちょっと便利そうな気がしますね、altrみたいなことをしてたのを機械的にDiagnosticsに変換してくれる感じで","ts":"1631969601.132900","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1631969604.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7kxA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"BF992046-90B2-42ED-9B06-6D3E093D4C79","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"できるかもしれないですね","ts":"1631969508.132200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eis"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42ef251d-5440-4d8c-ad1f-b28f3e63048f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"これ極端な話、rspec側で落ちたテストをメソッドと紐付けるLSPがあれば、その結果をDiagnosticsとして実装側に表示するとかで一部は対応できるんですかねぇ","ts":"1631969399.131700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oo/0V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B0C800F5-9BF9-4140-80C6-5078B4E328BD","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"それはみんな欲しい","ts":"1631969005.130800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pKLQx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1eea604d-3eef-4b04-bc2d-ea573bfc6ceb","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"リファクタとかの変更の話はそれに落ちるとして、CompletionやDiagnosticsが強力に動いてくれるのは別途欲しいではあるんですが・・・","ts":"1631968975.130400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vz2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a85f9c8-80ff-460d-9364-4e7867f63e63","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"型で守るのと同レベルにメソッドの粒度を小さくしてテストをちゃんと書け、に落ちる気がしてきました","ts":"1631968756.127500","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1631968764.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6r2dT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c4493bb6-4566-4aef-bfc0-d64805442529","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"関係なくではないか、ただでかいメソッドでもインラインでtype書いて安全にするようにはしてるつもりなんですよね","ts":"1631968707.127000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fz=0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed897285-48ab-45a2-ab61-9c6191180467","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"メソッドがでかさに関係なく、TSの型については勝手に安全に守ってくれてるみたいなのはあるかも","ts":"1631968646.126300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CEl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"84EBD039-AEC7-43C6-887B-727054B458C4","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"メソッドの中身が複雑だと、テストも複雑で規模が大きくなるし、コストが高くなりやすくなるのはわかる。","ts":"1631968596.125600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xG0S7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7dfe302a-689e-4599-8427-b66ec39d3382","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"それはあるかも、プライベートでは小さく切れてると思うんですけど業務のRailsだと結構でかいと思います","ts":"1631968519.124000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bn/0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3E4BD978-9013-4752-A384-B7FFA9425424","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"たぶんそうで、なんとなくですけど、ひとつのメソッドがでかいんじゃないですかね？","ts":"1631968478.122900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bVN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bd0f3547-2abd-4773-8818-06dc711ecbcd","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"否定しているとかではなくて単純に感覚の違いだけだと思うので、自分がテスト書くのをもっといい感じにしていったら変わるかも","ts":"1631968477.122800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vo0Vm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7fea89d-fbe9-4760-9680-c945618de59c","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"なるほど、この辺はどういう開発フローしてるかで変わるのかな、難しいですね","ts":"1631968426.121100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CcqzG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B7EA5F96-FA1F-49A3-9665-51699E078F38","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"そこと型のコスト天秤はやっぱりよくわかんないですね。LSPで補完してくれたり、関数を使うときに型エラーが出てくれるのは便利だと思いますけど、それは新規で書くときの話であって、変更とかのときはあんまり関係ないかな。","ts":"1631968378.120500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QxOoW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c58c3c1-e58c-43d6-ac05-f129669138d9","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あと、typeを変更した場合にLSPのCompletionやDiagnosticsが効くから変更に対しての修正が容易","ts":"1631968331.119200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V82oL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"25dea1e4-82da-48ad-b874-3d5a49e6ae00","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"多分コスト感の違いかな、自分はtypeの変更をしてから合わせるコストはrspecとかを修正してから合わせるより低いと思ってるんだと思います","ts":"1631968279.117200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U06cQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0369b60-0352-47dd-82ef-ecf3bf65e1f3","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、そこは同じ認識であってます","ts":"1631968210.115400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XSA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20FF7E85-AFD7-403F-9165-94EDF01BA5CD","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"もし、テストにエラーが出なければコードの修正する必要もないってことになる。","ts":"1631968174.115100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q=nR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3CCECB32-65D0-445D-8B6E-699E4D3F1436","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"typeを修正するということは、その前にテストが変更されるってことという認識ですね。その時点で変更範囲がテスト結果で可視化されます。","ts":"1631968117.114200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MrFk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"26f7e3e8-2b04-4e34-8753-21f1b6c7a1c8","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ちゃんとテストで担保するべきというのはその通りで、自分はそこの記述コストや安全さの程度を比較して型がほしいって感覚だと思います","ts":"1631968056.112800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L2Iw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0e1b77a-836d-4796-99c8-22abda1b855e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"typeを修正したら直さないといけない部分の一覧が機械的に安全に抽出される、とかって型じゃないと大分難しくないです？","ts":"1631967992.111900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Ix"}]},{"client_msg_id":"120BBEF3-D5E6-4981-BF8E-4304F0B15D8A","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"でしょうね。信用がテストで担保されているのであれば、それ以外を信用する必要はないという認識ですね。それはTSもRubyも関係ないです。","ts":"1631967992.111800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kqk8F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ac823630-8a83-473d-912f-ca7fdece23c3","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"うーん、そこの感覚には乖離がありそうです","ts":"1631967908.109100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w3g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9DDFAE70-AA9A-461D-868A-079322B4D4F7","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"一部の保証があっても、問題なく動く保証じゃない以上、そこはあってもなくても一緒だと思うんですけどね。","ts":"1631967885.108800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WN+4O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65f9a120-8cd0-405a-9925-57e078ba37ba","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"実装が正しいことの保証はテストでしかできないので","ts":"1631967795.107100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ju46k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c70386a-b5fd-4a68-94b7-c1f44d461bd0","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"一部が保証される、って感じですかね","ts":"1631967776.106300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vcbs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83296E26-78CC-436C-93BA-1E2768B5D198","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"確認コストはテストでカバーする範囲だから、型があっても保証されるものではないと思うなぁ","ts":"1631967715.105600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VkgxA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"714939db-90fb-4331-9e8c-5c2b24b6069b","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"置換漏れとかが自動で検出できるなら、どう考えてもソッチのほうがいいですもんね。（それを達成するためのトレードオフがどの程度あるのか。というのはありそうですが）","ts":"1631967711.105400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mEa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79294e00-9b91-40ac-8b63-e4d547929fdb","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"grepしたものを置換は自分もよくやるしそれがいいと思うんですけど、そのときに動くかどうかの確認コストがどうしても高くなっちゃうって感覚ですね\n確かに自分の作業がもっと最適化されたらそれでもある程度効率良いかもです","ts":"1631967640.102700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KKu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5542003-cb38-4997-a5a6-661f46e219f9","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"型については整備中という認識なので座して待つになりそうですね。","ts":"1631967625.102100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"contribute-chance","count":1,"users":["U03C71D7H"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yda"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0912777E-43A7-49EC-9214-2D10B34586F7","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"僕の場合は、Emacsでrgしたものをさらに置換すれば安全に一瞬で置換できるって意味ですね。\nRubyMineは使ったことないです。","ts":"1631967517.099200","thread_ts":"1631967409.094800","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DW3"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"f9d6faf2-05b4-4a77-bdc6-b6f9b91c2b9e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u0026gt; エディタの機能を使いこなせている人からすれば、誰でも使えて便利だよね\n例えばRubyは現状LSPが強くないだけで、RubyMineだとある程度勝手にやってくれるよねとかの意味で合ってます？","ts":"1631967409.094800","thread_ts":"1631967409.094800","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1631967416.000000"},"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MDP"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"c8906604-f15a-481c-92c0-06df4b3e73e1","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"そう、Railsが悪いというかTSの型に慣れてしまったせいで、相対的にRailsがきつく感じちゃってる感じですね","ts":"1631967505.098800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B1F7R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17a9f55f-747a-45d5-8613-6738829ec6f9","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"Rails がどうというよりは型が欲しい！って感じですよね。それはみんななんらかの形でそうなってほしいと思ってると思います。","ts":"1631967452.097100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IoG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f9d6faf2-05b4-4a77-bdc6-b6f9b91c2b9e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u0026gt; エディタの機能を使いこなせている人からすれば、誰でも使えて便利だよね\n例えばRubyは現状LSPが強くないだけで、RubyMineだとある程度勝手にやってくれるよねとかの意味で合ってます？","ts":"1631967409.094800","thread_ts":"1631967409.094800","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1631967416.000000"},"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MDP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ba11cd4-ab4f-4599-aab1-2926b6e86f30","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ただ、型があると開発体験やインラインのテストとしての有用性はめちゃくちゃ高いイメージです","ts":"1631967361.094000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lqy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36F08000-54A1-48DA-9913-E0AD750EF543","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"LSPのリファクタリング機能も、いうてもエディタの機能を使いこなせている人からすれば、誰でも使えて便利だよねって感じじゃないですかね","ts":"1631967357.093900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wy16J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab05edb2-f41c-442b-bb1c-29523c24cf81","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"型はテストのサブセットだと思ってます、当然全て型が解決するわけではない","ts":"1631967300.092200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+oLIz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"53016776-205C-4CE6-AE81-E7103F391130","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"型やLSPが機械的に検知してくれるのは便利ですけど、それとテストの持つ意味はやっぱり別かな。なので、どちらかがあればそれだけですべてカバーされるようなものではないという認識ですね。","ts":"1631967257.090300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eVlew"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5b3646b-cd18-4b9e-b287-0e19101d2845","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"実際Rubyの言語の柔軟さARが実装されてるとは思っていて、そこはめちゃくちゃいいと思ってるんですが","ts":"1631967251.090100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d7/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ecc59237-6993-49e6-8acc-65eadecff02f","type":"message","user":"UCFEJF487","text":"テストなしのRailsは破綻しそうとは思いますね、規模に関係なく。Ruby自体がテスト以外の保証の仕組みを持たないので。","ts":"1631967229.089100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"433"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc854720-63f5-4e93-ac12-2b00666a0f31","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"現代のTSがLLの特異点みたいなところもある気がする","ts":"1631967184.087100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"siV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"986f7ee9-abbb-4976-9c7f-19a4d80b8c34","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"まぁ、テストでどうにかなるという意味では機能面についてはそこまで困らないのかもしれない\n自分がテストをちゃんと書けてないだけの可能性は高いです","ts":"1631967125.085600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cdhq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8e2b371-2a39-403b-a649-b32fac2e1f48","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"コード書くだけでテストになるTypeScriptに比べると面倒なのはあると思う","ts":"1631967090.084900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tmxe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19a782f7-3a5b-48f8-b639-7c65ee4da5d4","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"テストである程度補完できるのはそうだと思ってます\nただ実装変更中に型やLSPレベルで機械的に検知してくれないと、相対的にどうしてもコスト高く感じちゃうんですよね","ts":"1631967058.084300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AejX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D1D8FF4B-2482-498F-8CD0-D4A28EAE5753","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"普通に、テスト変更→レッド確認→コード修正→グリーン確認→必要に応じでリファクタリングの流れなんじゃないですかね","ts":"1631967055.084000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sU9k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d26168da-ea7f-4915-aacf-68b06568531d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"テスト書いておくべきというのはそれはそう","ts":"1631967055.083900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fKU5Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"332b23fa-2e24-4a8f-aba3-fed6bd1556b5","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"メンタルモデルの変更が必要になって色んなところに変更加えないといけないときってどういう手順で対応しています？","ts":"1631966948.079600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9KtWF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A84DC8EF-A629-487B-9155-3C1B01C15553","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"リネームはちゃんとテスト書いておけば検知できるからコスト高いと思ったことないな","ts":"1631966945.079300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"76Ed"}]},{"client_msg_id":"940ba639-6128-41ff-a7e3-e6ddc9e85dbe","type":"message","user":"UCFEJF487","text":"Railsで7,8年開発していますが、中規模以下なら基本的に問題ないフレームワークだとは思います。","ts":"1631966905.077400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8wCR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1debaa36-6122-43ab-a575-5fa329227b93","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"某氏がRailsは破綻しやすいと言っていたけどそれかー","ts":"1631966900.077200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BhNZL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91fe6dd1-6d8b-4932-9eae-0d7ba5713f04","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u003c#CB2NMV0GN|lang-ruby\u003e で延々ディスってて良くない感じがしてきた","ts":"1631966884.076400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mXbF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db4a60da-9d4d-403e-a3a7-697553ca7581","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"型の変更やリネームみたいなのが追えないから現実的にコストが払えなくて実装が歪む","ts":"1631966853.075600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wg7Wg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c83040d5-5809-40d3-b5c2-fe0a57e63699","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"規模が大きくなったときのRailsの辛いところ、grepで追うしかないせいでドメインモデルが変わったときに安全な変更ができないせいで負債になりやすいみたいなのがあると思ってるんですよね","ts":"1631966794.074600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EiwLW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1fc421d7-de5a-4786-aa87-af6796c0ec0c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"というより動的型言語の上に実装された割に色々できるTSが変わってる気がしなくも","ts":"1631966753.073800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4gfdG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95d8d966-44f0-4c47-859a-9e4f7ebadd2c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"それは厳しい","ts":"1631966729.072900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qD4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"946778af-6418-439d-a789-3a9c195aeb81","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"型と、そこから続く問題としてDefinitionやReferencesがまともに使えないから変更のコスト高すぎるんですよね・・・\n人間がチェックしなくていいはずのところを全部grepで追う必要がどうしても","ts":"1631966698.072600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/If"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b233065-73bd-4791-935c-55ed364c121e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"型は大事","ts":"1631966602.071100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A+k2M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"007d60b6-b7e1-43a7-87f8-d45b6a449053","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"Railsは動くか分からんが勘でショートハンドで書いてちゃんと動いてめっちゃ便利みたいな感覚があって、TS以前のJSは機能や文法がRubyより貧弱な上に同じように勘で書くしかないみたいなところあったんだけど現代のTSが強すぎる","ts":"1631966489.070600","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1631966507.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W=iN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"735585ab-2635-407e-97dc-d4b673e1c58f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"リファクタの難易度とかが高すぎるのどうにかならないかなぁとずっと思っています","ts":"1631966184.068800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HbIN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0cbf16c-ada3-4161-b60d-1b98b82a2aa9","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"現代の型推論に慣れたせいでRubyどんどん辛くなっていく","ts":"1631966061.068300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XRD"}]},{"client_m